pacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">I hate your trainers.</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/1/18/I_hate_your_trainers..png/revision/latest?cb=20210212051217\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"I hate your trainers.\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/1/18/I_hate_your_trainers..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20210212051217\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/1/18/I_hate_your_trainers..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20210212051217 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/1/18/I_hate_your_trainers..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/536?cb=20210212051217 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"I hate your trainers.\" width=\"270\" height=\"152\" data-image-key=\"I_hate_your_trainers..png\" data-image-name=\"I hate your trainers..png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"series\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Series</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Series_10\" title=\"Series 10\">10</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"episode\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Episode</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">5</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"winner\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Winner</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Richard_Herring\" title=\"Richard Herring\">Richard Herring</a></div>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Episode Guide</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\">← Previous</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\">Next →</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\"><a href=\"/wiki/Toshwash.\" title=\"Toshwash.\">Toshwash.</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hippopotamus.\" title=\"Hippopotamus.\">Hippopotamus.</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><i><b>I hate your trainers.</b></i> is the fifth episode of <a href=\"/wiki/Series_10\" title=\"Series 10\">Series 10</a> of <i><a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster\" title=\"Taskmaster\">Taskmaster</a></i> and was first broadcast on <a href=\"/wiki/Channel_4\" title=\"Channel 4\">Channel 4</a> on 12 November 2020. The episode was won by <a href=\"/wiki/Richard_Herring\" title=\"Richard Herring\">Richard Herring</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Episode_title\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode title</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Alternate_titles\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Alternate titles</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Episode_breakdown\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode breakdown</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Trivia\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Trivia</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#External_links\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">External links</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_title\">Episode title</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode title\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/I_hate_your_trainers.?veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode title\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>\"I hate your trainers\" was an aggressive piece of criticism hurled at <a href=\"/wiki/Mawaan_Rizwan\" title=\"Mawaan Rizwan\">Mawaan Rizwan</a> by <a href=\"/wiki/Greg_Davies\" title=\"Greg Davies\">Greg Davies</a>, as Mawaan demonstrated his ability to deal with aggressive people, during the <a href=\"/wiki/Do_something_out_of_character_with_this_%C2%A320\" title=\"Do something out of character with this £20\">Do something out of character with this £20</a> task. A teabag is used for the title card, referencing the bagging in the <a href=\"/wiki/Bag_the_heaviest_thing_from_the_furthest_distance\" title=\"Bag the heaviest thing from the furthest distance\">Bag the heaviest thing from the furthest distance</a> task and the teapot in the <a href=\"/wiki/Paint_a_picture_of_a_howling_wolf_on_this_teapot\" title=\"Paint a picture of a howling wolf on this teapot\">Paint a picture of a howling wolf on this teapot</a> task.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Alternate_titles\">Alternate titles</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/I_hate_your_trainers.?veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li>On Denmark's TV2 Play streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Jeg hader dine kondisko', which translates as 'I hate your sneakers'. Danish has two words for sports shoes, which correspond to the English words 'sneakers' and 'trainers'. 'Kondisko' translates to 'sneakers'.</li>\n<li>On Finland's MTV Katsomo streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Vihaan lenkkareitasi', which translates as 'I hate your trainers'.</li>\n<li>On Sweden's SVT Play streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Statiskt mobilt måleri', which translates as 'Static mobile painting'. This is a reference to the <a href=\"/wiki/Paint_a_picture_of_a_howling_wolf_on_this_teapot\" title=\"Paint a picture of a howling wolf on this teapot\">Paint a picture of a howling wolf on this teapot</a> task.</li>\n<li>On Norway's Discovery+ Norge streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Jeg hater joggeskoene dine', which translates as 'I hate your trainers'. Note: this Norwegian translation of the title only appears in the subtitles for the episode, whereas the episode title listed on the platform is the original English title.<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_breakdown\">Episode breakdown</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/I_hate_your_trainers.?veaction=edit&amp;section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mbox\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;wrapper\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;header\">Spoilers!</div><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;text mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-spoilers\">This section contains spoilers.</div><span class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;close mw-customtoggle-spoilers\" title=\"Dismiss\"></span></div></div></div>\n<table class=\"tmtable\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"tmtableheader\">\n<th>Task\n</th>\n<th>Description\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Daisy_May_Cooper\" title=\"Daisy May Cooper\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Daisy May Cooper</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Johnny_Vegas\" title=\"Johnny Vegas\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Johnny Vegas</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Katherine_Parkinson\" title=\"Katherine Parkinson\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Katherine Parkinson</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Mawaan_Rizwan\" title=\"Mawaan Rizwan\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Mawaan Rizwan</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Richard_Herring\" title=\"Richard Herring\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Richard Herring</span></a>\n</th></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Best_pointy_thing\" title=\"Best pointy thing\">1</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Prize:</b> Best pointy thing.\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Bag_the_heaviest_thing_from_the_furthest_distance\" title=\"Bag the heaviest thing from the furthest distance\">2</a>\n</td>\n<td>Bag the heaviest thing from the furthest distance. Your attempt ends when you have bagged an item. Your score is the weight of the bagged object in grams multiplied by the distance from the bagging machine in centimetres.\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Paint_a_picture_of_a_howling_wolf_on_this_teapot\" title=\"Paint a picture of a howling wolf on this teapot\">3</a>\n</td>\n<td>Paint a picture of a howling wolf on this teapot. You may not touch the teapot or remove it from the turntable and you may not tamper with the turntable or its power. The turntable will keep speeding up until you have named 20 American states. If you do name 20 American states, the turntable will slow down.\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Do_something_out_of_character_with_this_%C2%A320\" title=\"Do something out of character with this £20\">4</a>\n</td>\n<td>Do something out of character with this £20.\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Eat_the_most_watermelon\" title=\"Eat the most watermelon\">5</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Team:</b> Eat the most watermelon. You must be wearing a boiler suit and goggles while you're eating the watermelon. You must not feed yourself.\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Say_the_most_different_words_without_hesitating\" title=\"Say the most different words without hesitating\">6</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Live:</b> Say the most different words without hesitating for more than two seconds. The person who says the fewest words each round is eliminated.\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtabletotal\">\n<th colspan=\"2\">Total\n</th>\n<td>24\n</td>\n<td>15\n</td>\n<td>20\n</td>\n<td>17\n</td>\n<td class=\"tmtablewinner\">26\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Trivia\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/I_hate_your_trainers.?veaction=edit&amp;section=4\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Trivia\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>This is to date the last episode to feature six regular tasks (with four taped tasks).</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: External links\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/I_hate_your_trainers.?veaction=edit&amp;section=5\" aria-label=\"Edit section: External links\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://taskmaster.tv/shows/i-hate-your-trainers\"><i>I hate your trainers.</i> on Taskmaster website</a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.channel4.com/programmes/taskmaster/on-demand/70911-005\"><i>I hate your trainers.</i> on All 4</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260920141504\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.062 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.115 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 605/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 25741/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 200/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 8/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 800544/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   61.938      1 -total\n 52.46%   32.493      1 Template:Spoilers\n 50.66%   31.379      1 Template:MessageBox\n 25.02%   15.498      1 Template:Episode_infobox\n 17.60%   10.898      1 Template:Episodes\n 10.75%    6.659     10 Template:Link\n  2.23%    1.381      5 Template:Color\n  2.18%    1.350      1 Template:Chronology\n  2.05%    1.269      1 Template:Clear\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_task:pcache:idhash:818-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260920141504 and revision id 42623. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}}}